---
title: Slowly Braised Pork Ragu with Pappardelle
description: "This Slowly Braised Pork Ragu Pappardelle is the ultimate comfort food meal!\r\nSucculent, juicy pork shoulder slowly simmers in a rich tomato sauce until it's fall-apart tender and able to shred with a fork. Finish with a splash of cream and generous sprinkling of parmesan. then toss the pork shoulder ragu into pappardelle pasta for the best homemade Italian meal. \r\nStovetop, oven, slow cooker and electric pressure cooker directions provided."
image: https://playswellwithbutter.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Pork-Ragu-Pappardelle-13-225x225.jpg
